@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class PriceServiceTest {
    @Mock ExchangeRateClient rates;

    @Test
    void convertsEurosToRupees() {
        when(rates.eurToInr()).thenReturn(new BigDecimal("90.00"));
        var service = new PriceService(rates);

        assertEquals(new BigDecimal("900.00"), service.inRupees(new BigDecimal("10.00")));
        verify(rates).eurToInr();
    }
}
```

The mock avoids a real network call. The stub supplies a known exchange rate, the assertion checks the service result, and `verify` confirms the required collaboration.

